<!--
  Static sitemap served as a real file so /sitemap.xml returns XML rather than
  falling through the SPA rewrite in vercel.json to index.html.

  Published public pages only. Deliberately excluded: /admin/*, /api/*,
  /admin/login, and the noindex pages /docs, /match, /results.
  Individual published opportunity pages are covered by the database-driven
  sitemap at /api/sitemap.xml, which robots.txt also advertises.

  Keep in sync with BROWSE_PAGES in src/lib/browse-pages.ts, GUIDES in
  src/lib/guides.ts, and STATIC_PATHS in
  artifacts/api-server/src/routes/sitemap.ts.
-->
